This includes, but is not limited to:

- Communication providers
- SMS providers
- WhatsApp providers
- Email providers
- Voice/telephony providers
- CPaaS providers
- Payment service providers
- Payment collection providers
- Owner payout providers
- IoT providers
- GPS/tracking providers
- Vehicle telemetry providers
- Identity/verification providers
- Maps/location providers
- Notification providers
- Marketing providers
- Infrastructure/service providers

Multiple providers may exist because of:

- regional availability
- pricing
- reliability
- coverage
- regulatory requirements
- capability differences
- API differences
- hardware compatibility
- customer requirements
- fallback/failover
- migration
- legacy support
- specialized functionality
- future readiness
- provider-specific contracts
- provider outages

Do not classify multiple providers as duplication without architectural evidence.

