5. PRESERVE INBOUND AND OUTBOUND FLOWS

Inbound communication is not equivalent to outbound communication.

Examples include:

Inbound:
Provider → Rentmaikar backend → message/thread/event

Outbound:
Rentmaikar → backend bridge → provider → recipient

Do not remove inbound webhook infrastructure because outbound API delivery works.

Do not remove outbound delivery because inbound webhooks exist.

Both directions must be inspected independently.

